WEBVTT

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:08.317
Not every contact deserves the same effort.

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:18.059
Each lead has a stage in its lifecycle - from Lead, to M-Q-L when it shows interest, to S-Q-L when there is a real opportunity, all the way to Customer.

00:00:18.059 --> 00:00:21.809
Lead scoring rates it as hot, warm or cold.

00:00:21.809 --> 00:00:31.314
We filter by stage, prioritise the hot contacts, and in the acquisition funnel we see the end-to-end conversion, from first contact to the sale.

